# 31. Final product objective

Project Canvas should establish a higher standard for visual diagram creation.

Its success depends on combining professional capability with an interaction model that makes sophisticated diagramming feel effortless.

A first-time user should be able to create a polished flowchart without training.

A software engineer should be able to create and modify a complex sequence diagram without drawing individual lines or manually rearranging lifelines.

An architect should be able to model layered systems and update their relationships without rebuilding diagrams.

An office planner should be able to create accurate layouts without learning professional CAD software.

Across every use case, the platform should maintain the same promise:

**Create visually. Connect intelligently. Modify effortlessly. Communicate clearly.**

The finished application should provide the functionality expected from a professional diagramming platform while delivering the speed, precision, and visual quality associated with modern design software.
